   "id": "A-1",
   "part": "A",
   "poc_lines": "15-36, 36+"
  },
  {
   "change": "for requested state 5 or 6: strip = (cp_c.special & 1) != 0 && (cp_c.previous & 31) == 25 evaluated ONLY when the record reloads (as the ROM selector does); walk: side contact (cp_c.contacts & 12) keeps the legacy sprite (frame $5E not imported) and takes precedence; when strip: wrap the shared index at 4, frame = $3C + index, counter 4 (run) or the walk duration table, mark the shadow active so present() draws SPR_chaos_player_frame_3x until the record ends",
   "file": "scripts/SCR_chaos_player_animation/SCR_chaos_player_animation.gml",
   "id": "A-2",
   "part": "A",
   "poc_lines": "12-35 (walk/run branch), 63-75 (present)"
  },
  {
   "change": "the legacy branch that mirrors facing from sign(vx) is skipped while presenting: keep cp_c.player_flags bit 4 current with chaos_player_facing_input(cp_c) in walk (ROM $3791 calls $48A7) and leave it untouched in run ($384D never calls $48A7)",
   "file": "same",
   "id": "A-3",
